  future behaviour, but on 31.1 it is active and changes how partial-
  completion matches. The comment should say so.
- The `dk/minibuffer-font-height` docstring describes the old approach (the
  prompt face), which `dk/minibuffer-small-font` explicitly explains did not
  work. The docstring contradicts the code.
Accurate comments matter here because this configuration relies on its
explanatory comments more than most.

WHAT IMPLEMENTING IT ACHIEVES
-----------------------------
- Byte compilation is clean again.
- Comments and docstrings match reality on Emacs 31.1.
- Open questions about Emacs 31 settings are surfaced to you, not silently
